            <ArticleTitle>Endophthalmitis after removal of an encircling band.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>178</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A case of endophthalmitis following the removal of an encircling band is presented. A possible route of entry in the absence of scleral perforation during the procedure is proposed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
